  "\t *\n",
  "\t *   c1(f) = f(x*w) = f0(x^3) + w*f1(x^3)*x + w^2*f2(x^3)*x^2\n",
  "\t *   c2(f) = f(x*w^2) = f0(x^3) + w^2*f1(x^3)*x + w*f2(x^3)*x^2\n",
  "\t *\n",
  "\t * It can be verified that:\n",
  "\t *\n",
  "\t *   N(f)(x^3) = f*c1(f)*c2(f)\n",
